4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maps will be generated procedurally, as well as most of the buildings and small areas placed on map, to make each area exploration unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free to switch for interaction FPS camera to handle indoor physical elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game is full of custom procedural animations giving more organic feel for characters and enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game also features the custom expansive sound system for precise audio modulation inside buildings as well as audio waves behavior in the forest (far animals/creatures sounds)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Is Currently In Early Stage Of Development.</h2>", "short_description": "Paragrowth is Survival RPG game placed in giant dark forest. Scavenge and explore countryside areas overgrown by trees and mysterious living roots. Find hideout to survive nights full of paranormal activities. Hunt mutating prey for ingredients to inject enemies abilities into yourself.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Polish, German<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761310/f7b4a57c4835ff4e149fdf5c7ada14cad223e8d9/header.jpg?t=1767963727", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761310/d1eeb52d603ea08d5f503f9ee9e3c7e566262787/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767963727", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761310/d1eeb52d603ea08d5f503f9ee9e3c7e566262787/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767963727", "website": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC-E7wD0EGkQyy1Ngu5Wh_LQ/videos", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.6 GHz Quad Core or similar<br></li><li><strong>